.key tag
; Memory per run, by stage (docs/release-resources-20260929.md).
; Each group: five runs between two 'Avail FLUSH'. The diagnostic build's
; log in RAM: is deleted before every measurement, since RAM: files count
; as memory in use. Run twice: Execute RAM:x/memtest3 A, then B.
Failat 21
; Warm-up: one of each, so libraries and fonts are loaded before counting.
RAM:x/leakctl
SetEnv XTERM_DIAG_EXIT_STAGE 1
RAM:x/termdiag --command RAM:x/m-exit
